<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="faq" id="faq">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="faq-head">
      <h2>Got Questions?</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <div class="faq-q">Do you ship overseas? <svg class="chev" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></div>
      <div class="faq-a"><div><p>We currently only ship to UK customers, but we'll be available worldwide very soon.</p></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <div class="faq-q">How long will it take to get my order? <svg class="chev" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></div>
      <div class="faq-a"><div><p>In the UK, all orders are received within 3–5 working days.</p></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <div class="faq-q">Can I return my order? <svg class="chev" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></div>
      <div class="faq-a"><div><p>Of course! If for any reason you'd like to return your socks, email us at hello@peachandflow.com and we'll help process your return.</p></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <div class="faq-q">How do I wash my socks? <svg class="chev" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></div>
      <div class="faq-a"><div><p>Machine wash inside out on a cool setting (30°C or below). Avoid the tumble dryer, air dry instead to keep the grip and shape intact.</p></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <div class="faq-q">Do your socks run true to size? <svg class="chev" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></div>
      <div class="faq-a"><div><p>Yes! Our socks are designed to fit UK sizes 3–6 / US sizes 5–9. They've got a comfortable stretch, so you'll get a snug, secure fit anywhere in that range.</p></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <div class="faq-q">What classes can I wear them in? <svg class="chev" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></div>
      <div class="faq-a"><div><p>Anywhere you'd want a bit of extra grip! Our socks are built for reformer and mat Pilates, yoga (hot included), barre, dance, and pretty much any low-impact workout where you'd usually go barefoot.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>



<script>
document.querySelectorAll(".faq-q").forEach(function(q){q.addEventListener("click",function(){q.parentElement.classList.toggle("open");});});
</script>
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "PF FAQ",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [{ "name": "PF FAQ" }]
}
{% endschema %}
